&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;新株予約権の数　※&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 375px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;80個&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 27px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 273px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;新株予約権の目的となる株式の種類　※&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 375px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: center"&gt;普通株式 単元株式数 300株&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 27px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 273px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;新株予約権の目的となる株式の数　※&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 375px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;24,000株&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 27px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 273px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;新株予約権の行使時の払込金額　※&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 375px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: center"&gt;１株当たり807円(注)１.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 37px"&gt;
