&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;金利スワップ&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; width: 167px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;借入金利息及び社債利息&lt;/p&gt;
